  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Grepped test files at dev 100b6fbb6e. Four files already use monkeypatch and cite the gotcha. Remaining: test_supply_chain.py:1578 (was ~L1553) guards supply_chain.py:1364-1366 'except (OSError, IOError): return False' (no pragma, no other test reaches it), and tests/test_scrub_secrets.py:219 skips as root. test_transcript_scrub_wiring.py:163 is an exec-bit test that holds as root. The root gap was read from the code, not demonstrated (reviewer uid 1002). MECHANISM: a chmod(0o000) read-denial is a no-op for root, so the except-OSError branch is uncovered in root CI."  # ff74
